{"seq":1,"slug":"guarantee-quota-occupy-release","title":"担保额度的占用与释放","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customs-tax-guarantee-bond-insurance/guarantee-quota-ledger/guarantee-quota-occupy-release","wordCount":2279,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"担保额度的占用与释放\">担保额度的占用与释放</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一张总担保保函在海关备案之后，就变成了一个可以被反复取用的容量池。企业每放行一票货物就从这个池子里取走一部分，税款缴库后再还回去。这个&quot;取&quot;与&quot;还&quot;的动作在系统里对应两个事件：<strong>占用（扣减）</strong> 与 <strong>释放（恢复）</strong>。看似简单，但这是整个 hub 里最容易出生产事故的地方——扣减重放会导致额度虚耗，释放错时机则会让海关在索赔时发现担保不足。本篇定义额度的记账模型与状态机，处理原子性、幂等与泄漏排查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"额度池的数据模型\">额度池的数据模型</h2><p>额度池的正确建模方式是<strong>事件溯源 + 快照</strong>：所有变化记录为不可变的扣减事件流，余额由事件流聚合得到，同时维护一个快照用于高频读取。这样做有两个直接好处——任何时刻的余额都可以重算验证，对账时有完整证据链。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 额度池：一份担保备案对应一个池&#10;CREATE TABLE quota_pool (&#10;  filing_no       TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  total_amount    NUMERIC(18,2) NOT NULL,     -- 备案总额度&#10;  frozen_amount   NUMERIC(18,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,  -- 冻结（申报中、未确认）&#10;  used_amount     NUMERIC(18,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,  -- 已确认占用&#10;  version         BIGINT NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,  -- 乐观锁&#10;  updated_at      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 扣减事件流：只追加，不修改&#10;CREATE TABLE quota_event (&#10;  event_id        BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  filing_no       TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES quota_pool(filing_no),&#10;  event_type      TEXT NOT NULL,   -- FREEZE / CONFIRM / RELEASE / ADJUST&#10;  decl_no         TEXT,            -- FREEZE/CONFIRM 时必填&#10;  amount          NUMERIC(18,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  idempotency_key TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,&#10;  legal_doc_ref   TEXT,            -- 依据：报关单号 / 缴款书号 / 海关回执号&#10;  occurred_at     TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 额度池：一份担保备案对应一个池</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> quota_pool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  filing_no       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  total_amount    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 备案总额度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  frozen_amount   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 冻结（申报中、未确认）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  used_amount     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 已确认占用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 乐观锁</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  updated_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 扣减事件流：只追加，不修改</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> quota_event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  event_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  filing_no       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_pool(filing_no),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  event_type      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- FREEZE / CONFIRM / RELEASE / ADJUST</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decl_no         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- FREEZE/CONFIRM 时必填</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  amount          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  idempotency_key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  legal_doc_ref   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 依据：报关单号 / 缴款书号 / 海关回执号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  occurred_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"为什么需要-freeze-与-confirm-两个事件\">为什么需要 FREEZE 与 CONFIRM 两个事件</h3><p>额度占用不是一步完成的。从企业决定申报到海关确认额度扣减成功之间有真实的时间差，这个窗口里额度必须被预留，否则并发申报会超发。因此采用两阶段：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>FREEZE</strong>：申报提交时冻结预估金额（按本票申报税额，不超过最高税款总额上限）。冻结只影响 <code>frozen_amount</code>，企业的其它申报看不到这部分额度。</li>\n<li><strong>CONFIRM</strong>：海关回执确认扣减成功后，把冻结转为确认占用。若回执显示失败或超时未达，则解冻。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; AVAILABLE: 备案生效&#10;  AVAILABLE --&gt; FROZEN: FREEZE 冻结预估额&#10;  FROZEN --&gt; CONFIRMED: CONFIRM 海关回执确认&#10;  FROZEN --&gt; AVAILABLE: 回执失败/超时, 解冻&#10;  CONFIRMED --&gt; RELEASED: RELEASE 税款缴库&#10;  RELEASED --&gt; AVAILABLE: 额度归还池&#10;  CONFIRMED --&gt; CLAIMED: 逾期, 海关抵缴&#10;  CLAIMED --&gt; [*]: 额度转为对外负债&#10;  AVAILABLE --&gt; SUSPENDED: 企业信用等级下调/暂停&#10;  SUSPENDED --&gt; AVAILABLE: 风险解除\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; AVAILABLE: 备案生效\n  AVAILABLE --&gt; FROZEN: FREEZE 冻结预估额\n  FROZEN --&gt; CONFIRMED: CONFIRM 海关回执确认\n  FROZEN --&gt; AVAILABLE: 回执失败/超时, 解冻\n  CONFIRMED --&gt; RELEASED: RELEASE 税款缴库\n  RELEASED --&gt; AVAILABLE: 额度归还池\n  CONFIRMED --&gt; CLAIMED: 逾期, 海关抵缴\n  CLAIMED --&gt; [*]: 额度转为对外负债\n  AVAILABLE --&gt; SUSPENDED: 企业信用等级下调/暂停\n  SUSPENDED --&gt; AVAILABLE: 风险解除</pre><h3 id=\"可用额度是一个推导值\">可用额度是一个推导值</h3><p>可用额度不落库，由下式推导：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>available</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>total_amount</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>used_amount</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>frozen_amount</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{available} = \\text{total\\_amount} - \\text{used\\_amount} - \\text{frozen\\_amount}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">available</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">total_amount</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">used_amount</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">frozen_amount</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个设计避免了&quot;余额字段与事件流不一致&quot;这类经典缺陷。若把 available 也存成字段，就必须在每次事件写入时同步更新两处，任何一处失败都会造成静默偏差，且偏差会随事件累积。推导值的代价是每次查询需要一次快照读取，用物化视图或缓存可以消解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"扣减的原子性与并发控制\">扣减的原子性与并发控制</h2><p>并发是额度系统的默认假设。同一企业的多票报关可能在不同申报通道同时提交，若不做控制会出现经典的双花问题：两票各自看到 600 万可用额度、各自需要 500 万，结果合计占用 1000 万而总额度只有 600 万。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 冻结：条件更新，用 version 做乐观锁，失败即重试&#10;UPDATE quota_pool&#10;   SET frozen_amount = frozen_amount + :need_amt,&#10;       version = version + 1,&#10;       updated_at = now()&#10; WHERE filing_no = :filing_no&#10;   AND total_amount - used_amount - frozen_amount &gt;= :need_amt&#10;   AND version = :expected_version;&#10;-- affected_rows = 0 表示额度不足或并发冲突，需重新读取后重试\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 冻结：条件更新，用 version 做乐观锁，失败即重试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_pool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> frozen_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> frozen_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :need_amt,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       updated_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> filing_no </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :filing_no</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> used_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> frozen_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :need_amt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :expected_version;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- affected_rows = 0 表示额度不足或并发冲突，需重新读取后重试</span></span></code></pre></div><p>把额度充足性判断写进 <code>WHERE</code> 子句是关键的工程选择：它让&quot;检查&quot;与&quot;扣减&quot;在一条语句内原子完成，避免了&quot;先 SELECT 再 UPDATE&quot;之间被并发插入的窗口。这条语句同时承担两个职责——并发冲突检测与额度不足判定——失败时系统需要通过重新读取版本来区分两者。</p>\n<h3 id=\"幂等键的构造\">幂等键的构造</h3><p>重放是必然的，因此每次扣减必须携带幂等键。可用的构造是 <code>filing_no + decl_no + event_type + 触发版本</code>。需要警惕的是&quot;看似不同实则同一笔&quot;的重放：报关单号相同但申报被退回后重新提交，会产生新的触发版本——这类情况必须被识别为一次新的扣减请求而非重放，否则会漏扣额度。区分依据是海关端的受理编号，而不是企业侧的申报流水号。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;quota_deduction_request&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;filing_no&quot;: &quot;ZB2026SH0000123&quot;,&#10;    &quot;decl_no&quot;: &quot;223120260000123456&quot;,&#10;    &quot;decl_version&quot;: 2,&#10;    &quot;event_type&quot;: &quot;FREEZE&quot;,&#10;    &quot;need_amt&quot;: 486300.0,&#10;    &quot;customs_accept_no&quot;: &quot;SH2026011800099&quot;,&#10;    &quot;idempotency_key&quot;: &quot;ZB2026SH0000123:223120260000123456:FREEZE:v2&quot;,&#10;    &quot;requested_at&quot;: &quot;2026-01-18T09:12:33+08:00&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"quota_deduction_request\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"filing_no\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ZB2026SH0000123\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"decl_no\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"223120260000123456\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"decl_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"event_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FREEZE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"need_amt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">486300.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"customs_accept_no\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SH2026011800099\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"idempotency_key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ZB2026SH0000123:223120260000123456:FREEZE:v2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"requested_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-01-18T09:12:33+08:00\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"释放的触发条件与时机\">释放的触发条件与时机</h2><p>释放比扣减更需要谨慎，因为<strong>过早释放等于在索赔到来之前拆掉担保</strong>。可释放的触发条件只有有限的几种，每一种都有法定依据。汇总征税制度明确&quot;担保额度可根据企业税款缴纳情况循环使用&quot;，且&quot;税款缴库后，企业担保额度自动恢复&quot;（<a href=\"http://policy.mofcom.gov.cn/claw/clawContent.shtml?id=62961\">海关总署公告2017年第45号</a>）；条例第二十条则列举了海关应书面通知办理退还手续的四类情形，包括当事人已履行法律义务、不再从事特定海关业务、被抵缴后仍有剩余等（<a href=\"https://www.gov.cn/flfg/2010-09/19/content_1709252.htm\">国务院令第581号</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>释放触发</th>\n<th>依据</th>\n<th>释放范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>税款缴库</td>\n<td>公告2017年第45号：税款缴库后额度自动恢复</td>\n<td>该票全部占用额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>担保义务履行完毕</td>\n<td>条例第二十条第一项</td>\n<td>该票全部占用额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不再从事特定海关业务</td>\n<td>条例第二十条第二项</td>\n<td>该业务全部占用额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抵缴后仍有剩余</td>\n<td>条例第二十条第三项</td>\n<td>剩余部分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>要素担保核实完成</td>\n<td>要素认定结论</td>\n<td>该笔要素担保额</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"缴库回执是释放的唯一可靠证据\">缴库回执是释放的唯一可靠证据</h3><p>公告明确&quot;税款缴库后，企业担保额度自动恢复&quot;。工程上要精确理解这句里的&quot;缴库&quot;——它是国库实际入库，而不是企业发起支付。两者之间有时延：从银行扣款到税款入库可能需要一到数个工作日，期间额度仍应视为占用。</p>\n<p>因此释放的触发事件必须是<strong>缴款书（海关专用缴款书）的入库回执</strong>，而不是支付成功回执。用后者会在极端情况下（支付成功但入库失败、退款）造成错误释放。这与资金系统里&quot;以对账单为准而非以支付指令为准&quot;的原则同源。</p>\n<h3 id=\"释放的幂等与顺序无关性\">释放的幂等与顺序无关性</h3><p>释放同样需要幂等键：<code>filing_no + decl_no + RELEASE + legal_doc_ref</code>。因为缴款回执可能重复推送。另外释放必须满足顺序无关性——同一票可能先收到部分缴款回执再收到全额回执，系统应当把释放金额累加并封顶在该票已确认占用额，而不是简单地&quot;收到即全额释放&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"额度泄漏的排查\">额度泄漏的排查</h2><p>额度泄漏指的是额度被占用却永远不释放，最终表现为可用额度持续下降、放行失败增多，而单笔账目又都&quot;看起来正常&quot;。它是本类系统最典型的慢性故障。</p>\n<h3 id=\"泄漏的三种成因\">泄漏的三种成因</h3><p>第一是<strong>冻结未终结</strong>。FREEZE 之后海关回执超时未达，系统没有超时解冻机制，冻结额永久停留。这是最常见的泄漏来源，也是唯一可以通过超时机制自愈的。</p>\n<p>第二是<strong>释放证据缺失</strong>。税款确实缴库了，但缴款回执因为对接故障没有进入系统。这类泄漏不会自愈，只能靠对账发现。</p>\n<p>第三是<strong>幂等键设计不当导致漏配</strong>。同一笔业务因申报退回重提产生了新的版本，旧版本的占用没有被终结。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 泄漏排查：找出超过合理时限仍未释放的确认占用&#10;SELECT e.decl_no,&#10;       e.amount,&#10;       e.occurred_at,&#10;       EXTRACT(DAY FROM now() - e.occurred_at) AS age_days,&#10;       CASE&#10;         WHEN NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM payment_receipt r WHERE r.decl_no = e.decl_no)&#10;           THEN &#39;RELEASE_EVIDENCE_MISSING&#39;&#10;         WHEN e.idempotency_key LIKE &#39;%:v1&#39; AND EXISTS (&#10;           SELECT 1 FROM quota_event e2&#10;            WHERE e2.decl_no = e.decl_no AND e2.idempotency_key LIKE &#39;%:v2&#39;)&#10;           THEN &#39;STALE_VERSION_NOT_TERMINATED&#39;&#10;         ELSE &#39;UNKNOWN&#39;&#10;       END AS suspected_cause&#10;  FROM quota_event e&#10; WHERE e.event_type = &#39;CONFIRM&#39;&#10;   AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM quota_event r&#10;                    WHERE r.decl_no = e.decl_no AND r.event_type = &#39;RELEASE&#39;)&#10;   AND e.occurred_at &lt; now() - INTERVAL &#39;45 days&#39;&#10; ORDER BY age_days DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 泄漏排查：找出超过合理时限仍未释放的确认占用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">decl_no</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">occurred_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       EXTRACT(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DAY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">occurred_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> age_days,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       CASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> EXISTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> payment_receipt r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">decl_no</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">decl_no</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'RELEASE_EVIDENCE_MISSING'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">idempotency_key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LIKE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '%:v1'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> EXISTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_event e2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">decl_no</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">decl_no</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">idempotency_key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LIKE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '%:v2'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'STALE_VERSION_NOT_TERMINATED'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'UNKNOWN'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> suspected_cause</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_event e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">event_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CONFIRM'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> EXISTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_event r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                    WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">decl_no</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">decl_no</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">event_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'RELEASE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">occurred_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'45 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> age_days </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>45 天这个阈值不是随意取的：汇总征税的纳税期限是次月第 5 个工作日，正常人库时延以天计，超过一个完整月度周期仍未释放的确认占用基本可以判定为异常。阈值的具体取值应结合企业自身的缴税节奏校准，并与 <a href=\"../guarantee-ops-optimize/guarantee-reconcile-audit\">担保台账对账与审计</a> 的差异分类表联动——报表里的&quot;无释放证据&quot;条目正是这里的第二种成因。</p>\n<h3 id=\"自愈设计\">自愈设计</h3><p>泄漏不可能靠人工清零，必须让系统能自愈。可行的机制是：每日对全量 CONFIRMED 且未 RELEASE 的占用做一次扫描，对超过阈值且无释放证据的记录，主动向海关或银行侧查询状态；确认已履行义务的直接生成释放事件，确认未履行的转入人工队列并挂起该业务的额度申请。关键点是<strong>释放事件由系统生成而不是等待外部推送</strong>，这让额度池不依赖单一数据通道的可用性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>额度池用事件溯源 + 快照建模，可用额度是推导值而非落库字段，避免余额与事件流不一致。</li>\n<li>占用分 FREEZE 与 CONFIRM 两阶段，冻结在海关回执确认后转为确认占用，失败或超时则解冻。</li>\n<li>冻结的条件更新语句把充足性判断写进 WHERE 子句，让检查与扣减原子完成。</li>\n<li>幂等键必须区分&quot;重放&quot;与&quot;申报退回后重提&quot;，后者是一次新请求，区分依据是海关受理编号。</li>\n<li>释放的唯一可靠证据是缴款书入库回执，不是支付成功回执；释放同样需要幂等并满足顺序无关性。</li>\n<li>额度泄漏的三种成因是冻结未终结、释放证据缺失、幂等键漏配，其中第一种可通过超时机制自愈，后两者依赖对账与主动查询。</li>\n<li>自愈设计的关键是释放事件由系统生成，而不是被动等待外部推送。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一步：担保品本身的状态如何流转，见 <a href=\"collateral-instrument-ledger\">担保品台账与状态</a>；额度可用性如何联动放行，见 <a href=\"quota-clearance-facilitation\">额度与清关便利联动</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"担保额度的占用与释放","id":"担保额度的占用与释放"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"额度池的数据模型","id":"额度池的数据模型"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么需要 FREEZE 与 CONFIRM 两个事件","id":"为什么需要-freeze-与-confirm-两个事件"},{"level":3,"text":"可用额度是一个推导值","id":"可用额度是一个推导值"},{"level":2,"text":"扣减的原子性与并发控制","id":"扣减的原子性与并发控制"},{"level":3,"text":"幂等键的构造","id":"幂等键的构造"},{"level":2,"text":"释放的触发条件与时机","id":"释放的触发条件与时机"},{"level":3,"text":"缴库回执是释放的唯一可靠证据","id":"缴库回执是释放的唯一可靠证据"},{"level":3,"text":"释放的幂等与顺序无关性","id":"释放的幂等与顺序无关性"},{"level":2,"text":"额度泄漏的排查","id":"额度泄漏的排查"},{"level":3,"text":"泄漏的三种成因","id":"泄漏的三种成因"},{"level":3,"text":"自愈设计","id":"自愈设计"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"担保工具的选择与成本比较","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customs-tax-guarantee-bond-insurance/tax-guarantee-instrument/guarantee-instrument-choice"},"next":{"title":"担保品台账与状态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customs-tax-guarantee-bond-insurance/guarantee-quota-ledger/collateral-instrument-ledger"}}